---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 专题
description: 按长期学习路径整理文章，而不只是按发布时间浏览。
permalink: /topics/
---
<section class="page-hero topics-hero">
  <div class="shell page-hero__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">KNOWLEDGE PATHS</p>
    <h1>专题</h1>
    <p>按长期问题和学习路径组织内容。每个专题都会随着实践推进持续补充和修订。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="topics-page">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="topic-grid topic-grid--page">
      {% for topic in site.topics %}
        <article class="topic-card topic-card--large">
          <div class="topic-card__top">
            <span>PATH 0{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <span>{{ topic.status }}</span>
          </div>
          <h2>{{ topic.title }}</h2>
          <p>{{ topic.description }}</p>
          <div class="topic-card__footer">
            <span># {{ topic.tag }}</span>
            <a class="text-link" href="/tags/#{{ topic.tag }}">查看相关文章 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <aside class="topics-principle">
      <p class="eyebrow">HOW IT GROWS</p>
      <h2>专题会如何持续生长</h2>
      <div class="topics-principle__steps">
        <div><span>01</span><strong>提出问题</strong><p>从真实需求或困惑开始，而不是先堆砌概念。</p></div>
        <div><span>02</span><strong>建立理解</strong><p>梳理背景、边界、实现方式和工程取舍。</p></div>
        <div><span>03</span><strong>实践修订</strong><p>用项目和反馈验证，再持续修正已有文章。</p></div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>